            "LocalizeEN": "Lots of people are wearing interesting outfits.\n\n...Huh? Why are you looking at me like that?\n\nI'm not wearing this for anything like that!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10045,
            "DialogCategory": "WeaponGet",
            "VoiceClip": "Hoshino_(Swimsuit)_ExWeapon_Get",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_HoshinoSwimsuit/HoshinoSwimsuit_ExWeapon_Get",
            "LocalizeEN": "You'd even do that for me...? Seriously, you're so weird. Well, I guess I don't mind. I should work a little harder!"
